==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Pikachu|49}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*'''Thunder Jolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
